# ZenithTech: Electronics Online Store (Frontend)

**Live demo:** https://ZeinthTech.vercel.app

A multi-page online store for electronics and gadgets, inspired by Uzum Market
and Wildberries. Built with vanilla HTML, CSS and JavaScript, with no frameworks.

![Home page](screenshots/home.png)

## Features

- Product catalog loaded from a JSON file
- Category filter, live search and sorting (price, rating)
- Product detail page with specifications and related products
- Shopping cart saved in `localStorage` (survives page reloads)
- Checkout form with validation (Uzbek phone number format)
- Orders saved locally, with a confirmation screen
- Responsive layout for mobile, tablet and desktop

## Tech stack

HTML5, CSS3 (Grid, Flexbox, custom properties), JavaScript (ES6+, fetch,
localStorage), deployed on Vercel.

